/**************************************************************************
 *
 *  File name  :  lang_de.rc
 *
 *  Description:  German language resource tables (namespace +30000).
 *		  Pure ASCII text (no umlauts), resource ids are the
 *		  base ids from main.h/dlg.h shifted by LANG_BASE_DE
 *		  (30000) so a single executable can carry all five
 *		  languages.
 *
 *		  This file is rcinclude'd from main.rc, so it must
 *		  not re-include OS2.H/MAIN.H/DLG.H by itself.
 *
 *  Concepts   :  multilingual single-executable resources
 *
 ***********************************************************************/

